  <data key="d0">Agri-Input Organizations</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Agri-Input Organizations refer to companies that provide agricultural inputs and support services, working with Farm Vaidya to enhance farmer accessibility to information.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-41a8512cee29cb09c7d8da7cb7471f19</data>
