  <data key="d0">Multilingual Interactions</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Multilingual Interactions involve communication in multiple languages, facilitated by Farm Vaidya's technologies to support farmers across different regions in India.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-41a8512cee29cb09c7d8da7cb7471f19</data>
