<node id="ChatBot">
  <data key="d0">ChatBot</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">ChatBot is an AI-powered tool designed for structured text-based engagement to answer product-related queries and assist users in local languages across digital platforms.&lt;SEP&gt;The ChatBot is part of Farm Vaidya's offerings, designed to assist users with agricultural queries through conversational interactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-41a8512cee29cb09c7d8da7cb7471f19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f471ff49dc2c427541bf8c97ee81b566</data>
