  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Dr Ramadugu Praveen is one of the founders of Farm Vaidya involved in developing agricultural solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr Ramadugu Praveen is the Founder and CEO of Farm Vaidya, holding a PhD in Horticulture and extensive experience in various agricultural roles.</data>
