  <data key="d2">G Jyotsna is one of the founders of Farm Vaidya and contributes to the organization’s mission and vision.&lt;SEP&gt;G Jyotsna is the Co-Founder and COO of Farm Vaidya, equipped with an MBA in Agri-Business and over 15 years of professional experience in agriculture.</data>
